  "notes": "Interim 100-card mono-white Commander deck for the Foundations Calling All Angels precon (official list unreleased; Ruling M3-P). Commanded by Giada, Font of Hope: the +1/+1-counter-on-angel-ETB engine wants a critical mass of Angels, and a life-gain subtheme (Soul Warden, Dawnbringer Cleric, Resplendent Angel, Righteous Valkyrie) powers the Angel token payoff and Serra/Serra's Guardian beatdown. Curve is skewed low (a dozen 1-2 drop creatures, 28 Plains) so the deck acts before turn 10; Swords/Path/Condemn and the O-Ring family handle permanents, Day of Judgment/Wrath of God wipe, Sun Titan recurs, Avacyn tops out. Colour identity is exactly white: every non-Plains land and artifact is colourless-identity (Karakas, Ancient Tomb, Sol Ring family), and no card carries a coloured symbol outside white.",
